When sharing any covered material, include these terms and preserve applicable copyright and licensing notices. Identify your modifications so recipients can distinguish them from the original release. Do not present a fork as an official Code Tree release without authorization.

You may grant rights in your own additions only to the extent that doing so does not authorize an activity prohibited for the covered Software. A fork's separate license cannot remove the restrictions on Code Tree material.

